# Real data never goes into git
data/*
# data/ covers financas.db, financas.db-wal, financas.db-shm, backups/, import/, images/ and logs/ (the real data).
# The ONE exception is the synthetic demo database (see the *.db rules below and the README):
# it is built from made-up data only, by `financas seed-demo`. Its -wal/-shm files stay ignored.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
!data/demo.db
*.sqlite*
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
!scripts/examples/*.csv
*.ofx
*.pdf
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Python / tooling
.venv/
.venv-win/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pyright/
.import_linter_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

CLAUDE.md
# Engineering records (audits, plans, the project history naming the owner's real banks): local only.
docs-dev/
